                                                "sense_id": "86cffcde-e25b-3d3e-a8e9-b192afa483f1",
                                                "text": "“Homeownership,” says John H. Mollenkopf, executive director of the Center for Urban Research at the City University of New York Graduate Center, “is the strongest predictor of being likely to turn out in local politics and being a bit more conservative and antitax in your general outlook.”"
